Article 4 (Schools Subject to School Meals) School meals shall be provided, as prescribed by Presidential Decree, to students enrolled in any of the following schools or classes. <Amended Mar. 21, 2012; Dec. 10, 2019; Jan. 29, 2020; Mar. 23, 2021>
1. Kindergartens under Article 2 subparagraph 2 of the Early Childhood Education Act, excluding kindergartens not exceeding the size prescribed by Presidential Decree;
2. Schools falling under any of subparagraphs 1 through 4 of Article 2 of the Elementary and Secondary Education Act;
3. Special classes for working youth and middle and high schools attached to industrial establishments under Article 52 of the Elementary and Secondary Education Act;
4. Alternative schools under Article 60-3 of the Elementary and Secondary Education Act;
5. Other schools deemed necessary by the superintendent of education.

